::warning file=domain/entities.go,line=40,col=1,title=W003 PostgreSQL column exists but is unmapped::column public.comments.author_id is not mapped%0A%0Athis column carries the foreign key for domain.Comment.Author. Rows inserted through domain.Comment cannot set it, so the relationship is read-only from this entity%0A%0AFix: map it as a scalar field on domain.Comment if you need to write it
