::error file=domain/entities.go,line=50,col=1,title=E023 primary key column has no mapped Go field::domain.Note has no field for the primary key column id of public.notes%0A%0Aan entity whose identity cannot be read back cannot be used with the write API: the generated key is discarded on insert, and update and delete have nothing to address%0A%0AFix: add a field for id to domain.Note
